# Intrude on the Mind: "Reveal the top five cards of your library and separate them into two piles. An opponent chooses one of those piles. Put that pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard. Create a 0/0 colorless
# Thopter artifact creature token with flying, then put a +1/+1 counter on it for each card put into your graveyard this way." (CR 701.20a, 700.3, 111.1, 122.1.) Black Lotus, Mox Sapphire and Mox Ruby pay the {3}{U}{U} exactly
# on turn 1, all five cards are revealed to Bot2 (Bot1.Revealed), Bot1 makes Lightning Bolt and Counterspell the first pile, Bot2 chooses the second (Dark Ritual, Mox Emerald, Mox Jet) for Bot1's hand and the first
# goes to the graveyard: a 2/2 flying Thopter, its two counters one for each of the two cards buried. Bot2's cards stay where they are.

